  "notes": "{融資|ゆうし} is a formal business/banking term for financing or lending.\n\nVERBAL NOUN:\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to provide financing\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧: to receive financing\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{申|もう}し{込|こ}む→申し込む：02311_moushikomu⟧: to apply for a loan\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧: to receive financing\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{断|ことわ}られる→断る：02102_kotowaru⟧: to be denied a loan\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦{審査|しんさ}→審査：08375_shinsa⟧: loan screening/review\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦{条件|じょうけん}→条件：03285_jouken⟧: loan terms\n- {融資|ゆうし}⟦{枠|わく}→枠：13100_waku⟧: credit line, loan limit\n\nTYPES OF FINANCING:\n- ⟦{銀行|ぎんこう}→銀行：00578_ginkou⟧{融資|ゆうし}: bank financing\n- ⟦{住宅|じゅうたく}→住宅：03280_juutaku⟧{融資|ゆうし}: housing loan\n- ⟦{事業|じぎょう}→事業：11421_jigyou⟧{融資|ゆうし}: business loan\n- {無担保|むたんぽ}{融資|ゆうし}: unsecured loan\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{貸付|かしつけ}→貸付：20020_kashitsuke⟧: lending (slightly less formal)\n- ⟦ローン→ローン：06579_roon⟧: loan (loanword, more casual)\n- ⟦{借入|かりいれ}→借入：07557_kariire⟧: borrowing\n- ⟦{返済|へんさい}→返済：04776_hensai⟧: repayment",
